sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant Store as Versioned session store
    participant Graph as Four-agent LangGraph
    participant Model
    participant Tool as Typed tool registry

    User->>API: message + optional session_id
    API->>Store: load and validate role/user/resolution binding
    Store-->>API: CaseFileState or no session
    API->>Graph: CaseFileState
    Graph->>Model: typed Supervisor/specialist request
    Model-->>Graph: validated contract
    Graph->>Tool: agent-scoped invocation
    Tool-->>Graph: typed result or CaseFileError
    Graph->>Store: persist bounded state and artifacts
    Graph-->>API: completed / needs_input / needs_confirmation / failed
    API-->>User: envelope with agent, tool, and model traces

    Note over Graph,Tool: Trace sequence numbers preserve execution order.
    Note over Model: Full prompts/responses appear only when developer exposure is explicitly enabled.
